Note: a notes bot built on a kind of thing and JSON. Every user keeps their own notes,
Note: the bot remembers them after a restart, and /export sends them as JSON.

a note has a text and a number (number).
remember everything in "notes-memory.json".
set saved to 0.

when someone sends "/start", reply "Send me any text to keep it as a note. Commands: /list, /find word, /export, /clear." with buttons "/list", "/export" and "/clear".

when someone sends "/list"
  if the number of items in their notes is 0, reply "No notes yet.".
  otherwise
    set their lines to an empty list.
    for every note in their notes, add the number of note and then "." and then the text of note to their lines.
    reply their lines joined with a new line.
  that's all.
that's all.

when someone sends a message that starts with "/find"
  set their word to (the message with "/find" replaced by "") trimmed.
  set their found to every note in their notes where the text of note contains their word.
  if the number of items in their found is 0, reply "Nothing about" and then their word and then ".".
  otherwise reply (the text of note for every note in their found) joined with a new line.
that's all.

when someone sends "/export", reply their notes as json.

when someone sends "/clear"
  set their notes to an empty list.
  reply "All your notes are gone.".
that's all.

when someone sends anything else
  add a new note with text the message and number the number of items in their notes plus 1 to their notes.
  add 1 to saved.
  reply "Saved as note" and then the number of items in their notes and then ". Everyone saved" and then saved and then "notes so far.".
that's all.
